{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a survival game blended with Roguelite elements, featuring a map composed of numerous random levels and straightforward gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is to dodge enemies while gathering experience, gold, and items, then use them to forge weapons and purchase gear and consumables.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through repeated upgrade choices and strategic combinations of weapons, items, and gems, your character grows increasingly powerful\u2014able to face hordes of monsters without fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience the thrill of mowing down enemies!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519700/extras/e2d3308a94ed5a98c88a857f23e9d8af.poster.avif?t=1762073922\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519700/extras/e2d3308a94ed5a98c88a857f23e9d8af.webm?t=1762073922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519700/extras/e2d3308a94ed5a98c88a857f23e9d8af.mp4?t=1762073922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Configurable Skill System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign weapons and gems to attack models to alter your skills and enhance your power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip Different Weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519700/extras/8da1434d7cfdf466957e1dea0a971ac2.poster.avif?t=1762073922\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519700/extras/8da1434d7cfd